---
title: Vanilla tart over four days
---

## Mother cream ~{-3d} ->&cream

[Whisk] Whisk @egg yolks{6} with @sugar{100g}, then add @milk{500ml} and @vanilla pod{2} in a #saucepan.

[Chill] Let the cream set in the fridge ~_{24h}.

## Praline ~{-2d} ->&praline

[Caramelize] Cook @sugar{150g} in a #pan until golden, then stir in @hazelnuts{200g}.

[Rest] Let the praline cool and harden ~_{12h}.

## Crust ~{-26h} ->&crust

[Mix] Work &cream{150g} with @flour{300g} and @butter{150g}(cold, cut into cubes) in a #bowl.

## Syrup ~{-25h} ->&syrup

[Simmer] Simmer &crust{50g} with @water{200ml} and @sugar{80g} for ~{10min}.

## Powder ~{-24h} ->&powder

[Grind] Blend &syrup{30g} with @almonds{100g} until powdery.

## Assembly

[Bake] Bake the &crust{400g} for ~{25min} at ^{180C}.

[Fill] Spread &praline{100g} on the tart, then dust with &powder{50g}.
